  "name": "Question 15",
  "problem": "If $U={5,10,15,\u2026,50}$ is the universal set and $C={5,15,25,35,45},$ then the complement of $C$ is",
  "worked_solution": "The complement of $C,$ denoted $\\overset{\u2015}{C},$ consists of every element in the universal set $U$ that is not in the set $C.$\n\nThe elements of $U$ that are not in $C$ are $10,20,30,40,$ and $50.$\n\nTherefore, the complement of $C$ is\n\n$$\n\\overset{\u2015}{C}={10,20,30,40,50}.\n$$",
